  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text {Hints: If } e^{\\int p d x}=e^{-\\int \\frac{3 x^2 d x}{1+x^3}}=e^{-\\log \\left(1+x^3\\right)}=e^{\\log \\left(1+x^3\\right)^{-1}} \\\\\n& =\\left(1+x^3\\right)^{-1}=\\frac{1}{1+x^3}\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
